    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>46244</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>見て、きれいな氷河と湖！
自然がつくった氷の芸術だねぇ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Would you look at those gorgeous glaciers! It's like an ice scupture carved by mother nature herself!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>46372</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>警告。
氷河湖の水温は、ほぼ０度。
人間が落ちたら数分で絶命する</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The temerature of this lake's water is a constant 0 degrees. If a person were to fall in, there would die in minutes.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>46676</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ぞぉぉ〜……
し、死の芸術だ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yikes... mother nature's pretty hardcore...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>46900</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>氷河の上の緑の場所……
あそこに結界思念石はあるんだよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The green patch above the ice is where the protective Will Stone is.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>47028</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>よし、全員駆け足！
万一、氷河湖に落ちたら
数分以内に対岸まで泳ぎきれよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Right. Men, on your feet! If you slip and fall into the lake, swim to the opposing shore at hast!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>50388</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>まぁた、自分は飛べるからって
無責任にッ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Says the guy who can FLY.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
